WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.474 --> 00:00:01.307
(dramatic classical music)

00:00:01.307 --> 00:00:02.140
- [Narrator] Sriracha is one of

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.110
the most popular hot sauces in the world,

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.940
but it's more than just a sauce.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.470
The story of how this humble hot sauce

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.860
became so ubiquitous starts with this man

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.650
who came to America as a refugee

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.020
and built one of the most successful

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.941
hot sauce companies in the world.

00:00:14.941 --> 00:00:18.858
(speaks in a foreign language)

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.270
- [Announcer] This Great Big
Story is brought to you by

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:30.320
Delta.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.970
When we venture out into the world

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.873
we see all that we share.

00:00:40.474 --> 00:00:41.640
(cheerful classical music)

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.310
- [Narrator] David Tran is
the owner of Huy Fong Foods,

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.370
the biggest and most well-known
sriracha brand out there.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.870
Today he's treating his
employees to an elaborate lunch

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:52.660
of king crab, dumplings, and yes, sriracha

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.810
at a popular dim sum restaurant
in Arcadia, California.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.230
But he wasn't always the
head of a big company.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:00.620
David came to America 40 years ago

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.475
after fleeing his home
country of Vietnam on a boat.

00:01:03.475 --> 00:01:07.392
(speaks in a foreign language)

00:01:28.163 --> 00:01:30.190
David didn't invent sriracha,

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:33.100
variations on the sauce are
found throughout Southeast Asia.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.260
In fact, it's named after

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.530
a town in Thailand with the same name.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.070
The recipe is simple;

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.738
the bottle lists just eight ingredients,

00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:42.602
but David's sauce has
a special ingredient.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.519
(speaks in a foreign language)

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:09.392
Even though he doesn't have

00:02:09.392 --> 00:02:11.370
any formal training in engineering,

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:14.300
David designed many of the
operations in his factory.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.685
He even designed the iconic bottle.

00:02:16.685 --> 00:02:20.602
(speaks in a foreign language)

00:02:50.582 --> 00:02:51.660
People from different cultures

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:54.295
don't just understand David's products,

00:02:54.295 --> 00:02:56.241
they adore them.

00:02:56.241 --> 00:03:00.158
(speaks in a foreign language)

00:03:26.438 --> 00:03:29.188
(harmonic notes)

